\viewkind4\uc1\pard\li288\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  1. \tab God the Creator, we adore You;\cf0 
\par \pard\li720\sl190\slmult0\qj All Your creation bows before You,
\par From east to west, from north to south,
\par You are clothed with majesty, honour.
\par You brightens earth's most distant corner
\par \pard\li720\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li720\sl190\slmult0\qj Your apparel the heav'nly light.
\par By Your great power You made heaven,
\par Sun, moon, and stars Your glory show,
\par But You Yourself surpass their splendour,
\par Far more than mortal man can know.
\par 
\par \pard\li288\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par      2. All You have made fills man with wonder,
\par \pard\li720\sl190\slmult0\qj   Lightning and cloud and rain and thunder,
\par Fire's fiercest heat and sunset's glow;
\par Tempest and wind pass on Your orders,
\par You fix the mighty ocean's borders,
\par \pard\li720\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li720\sl190\slmult0\qj You make the streams and rivers flow.
\par You have created every species-
\par Fish, reptile, bird, and mammal too -
\par You quench their thirst, give food and pasture,
\par All living things depend on You.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

